Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi everyone,

I'd like to revive the discussion on KIP-1370, which proposes including
Streams group member instance IDs and rack IDs in the output of
kafka-streams-groups.sh.
- KIP: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/44CWGg

Since the discussion has been inactive for a while, I'd appreciate any
additional feedback or concerns from the community so that we can move the
proposal forward.
Thanks for your time and feedback!

