Hi Chia-Ping,

Thanks for the review.

chia_00: You're right, I was overthinking it. I removed the check from the
KIP, so the new handler will ignore all JAAS options.

chia_01: That makes sense. I updated the KIP so the log will be WARN and
suggest OAuthBearerTokenlessLoginCallbackHandler.

Best,
Ming-Yen

