Hi all,

I'm reviving this old thread for an update. We have published an improved
version of our previously internal-only tool for recovering clusters from
the kind of scenario discussed in this thread.

It's available under an Apache 2.0 license here:
https://github.com/Aiven-Open/kraft-last-standing.

