--000000000000289728065f4cd23c
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi all,

I would like to start a vote on KIP-1342: Deprecate Authorizer#aclCount
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/i5QmGQ>

Authorizer#aclCount() was added for a broker-side metric that was never
implemented. Since KIP-877, StandardAuthorizer publishes acls-total-count
through PluginMetrics, so this KIP deprecates the method in 4.5 and removes
it in 5.0.

Discussion thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/0frtc6h3y9ts89do3qb9yk6oj3o1ktg2

Thanks,
Ming-Yen

