c780a8
> removes the explicit truncating phase that sends
> OffsetForLeaderEpochRequest from AbstractFetcherThread. So inter-broker
> replication now relies entirely on truncate-on-fetch. Are we planning to
> introduce OffsetForLeaderEpochRequest in the cluster mirroring fetcher
> because we think there is a requirement to migrate from older clusters? O=
r
> are we planning to keep the code simpler and support newer clusters only?
>
> Thank you,
>
> Rajini
>
