Hi Federico,

Thanks for the response. I think we removed the old code in
AbstractFetcherThread to reduce complexity and maintenance cost. It seems
odd that we would bring back all that complexity in a subclass. Not sure if
there are users who are still on old broker versions like 2.1 (unlike
clients). I would have thought that it is sufficient to support 3.0+. It
will be good to understand how much compatibility we expect to maintain for
5.0 and beyond. Let's see what others think too.

Regards,

Rajini


