--------------------------------------

             Summary: Remove setGenerateCallback
                 Key: KAFKA-21420
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21420
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


{{setGenerateCallback}} is a testing-only method which provides a way to observe the {{nodeRPCMap}} before generating the requests. However, the true issue we care about is whether those RPCs are batched into a single request. Hence, we could rewrite those test cases to verify the requests instead of the inner state. Also, {{setGenerateCallback}} can be stripped out.



